# Incompatible API changes the API diff gate allows, one per line:
#
#   <module dir><TAB><the line apidiff prints>
#
# The module directory is "." for the root. Each block starts with a comment
# naming the PLAN and step that allow its changes. A release's close-out
# removes its entries: once the next tag is the base, apidiff no longer
# prints them, and scripts/go-apicheck.sh fails on them as stale
# (docs/decisions/0014-PLAN-api-policy-gates.md Step 4).

# docs/decisions/0014-PLAN-canonicalization.md Step 9: the names W4
# deprecated in v0.9.0, removed in v0.10.0 (0014-MADR-native-integration-api W4).
.	- ./command.Decision: removed
.	- ./command.Invocation.Context: removed
.	- ./command.Record.Decision: removed
.	- ./command.Request.Context: removed
.	- ./layout.BottomHeight: removed
.	- ./layout.BottomSpan: removed
.	- ./layout.Breakpoints: removed
.	- ./layout.Footer: removed
.	- ./layout.Gap: removed
.	- ./layout.MainSize: removed
.	- ./layout.NoResponsive: removed
.	- ./layout.SidebarWidth: removed
.	- ./termcap.New: removed
.	- ./termsvc.WithGate: removed
.	- ./workspace.WithMouse: removed
